    "**ADAM ID: **[sm\\_us6000rik7](https://api.adam.geospatial.wfp.org/api/collections/adam.adam_eq_events/items?uid=sm_us6000rik7) Magnitude 5.5 earthquake at 69.758 depth occurred on Oct 22 2025 25km SE of Santa Rosa. The epicentre of the earthquake was located at latitude -3.6247 longitude -79.8229. It impacted 547397 people within 50km. WFP’s Automated Disaster Analysis and Mapping (ADAM) system is an operational system for collecting, analysing and mapping geospatial and socio-economic information following sudden onset humanitarian emergencies."
